Call to Action / Outro thoughts
- To inspect:
    a. browse for manual review
    b. Pass url to agent for conversational review
    c. (when repocontract system implemented) Pass evalcopy.zip to agent for conversational review
- To try:
    1. Install:
        - must install pyhon, must install ruamel
        - clone repo
        - symlink entrypoint per preference, suggest 'clank'
    2. Start app:
        - enter repo directory
        - enter 'clank'
        - select a domain, select a prompt, paste into llm browser interface

